{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14055","headline":"赠别刘员外长卿 · 耿湋","name":"赠别刘员外长卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清如寒玉直如丝，世故多虞事莫期。\n建德津亭人别夜，新安江水月明时。\n爲文易老皆知苦，谪宦无名倍足悲。\n不学朱云能折槛，空羞献纳在丹墀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14055.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14055","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}